# TextStats

TextStats targets Python 3.11+ for a text statistics API and command-line utility. The current T-002 checkpoint supplies immutable `TextStats` values and silent whole-input `count_text` and `count_file` APIs. Named files are read without byte changes and decoded as strict UTF-8; owned handles close on success and failure. The module CLI remains a later task. The [project brief](docs/dev/PROJECT.md) captures the full delivery boundaries; complete runnable usage instructions will be added with the documentation milestone.

Development uses [SDD Manager](SDD-MANAGER.md). See the [AI-assisted development disclosure](AI_DISCLOSURE.md).
